    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Like many natives of the Moonshae Isles, you grew up revering the blessed land, its unique gods, and the mysterious shrines known as moonwells. As a moonwell pilgrim, you set out to visit and commune with every moonwell, whether or not it appears on a map. Along these idyllic journeys, you gathered a repertoire of Moonshavian folk songs, painted enchanting landscapes, and even learned to wield a little primal magic.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.3cZndrZX1F7P01f9]{Magic Initiate (Druid)}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Nature and Performance</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulPaintersSu]{Painter's Supplies}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepQuartersta]{Quarterstaff}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulPaintersSu]{Painter's Supplies}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBell0000000]{Bell}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouch}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRobe0000000]{Robe}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagString00000]{String}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 34 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
